@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Create planned sprint
actor "Authorized user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "SprintsPage or SprintBoardPage\nSprintFormDialog / SprintForm" as page
  participant "ISprintService / SprintService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "SprintsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "CreateSprintCommandHandler" as handler
  participant "Sprint" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Plan sprint with name, goal, and Toronto start and end dates
page -> client : Build typed CreateSprintCommand
client -> access : POST /api/workspaces/{id}/sprints
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT; deactivated account
  access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads
  client --> page : SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once; sign in with the current tab as return route
else Authenticated (profile P: every active role plans sprints)
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
  ctrl -> validation : Send CreateSprintCommand through MediatR 12.5.0
  validation -> validation : L2-022 trim; name 1-200, goal 1-2,000, valid dates, end on or after start
  alt Missing, over-limit or malformed fields; end before start
    validation --> ctrl : 400 field errors; nothing read or changed
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : Keep all input; one field error focuses that field, which reads its error;\nseveral focus the linked error summary; no Retry or reference ID
  else Valid request
    validation -> handler : Handle CreateSprintCommand
    handler -> db : BeginWorkspaceTransactionAsync (workspace lock); LoadWorkspaceAsync: existence and delivery mode
    alt Workspace lock wait exceeds the configured timeout
      db --> handler : Lock timeout; nothing read or changed
      handler --> ctrl : 503 with Retry-After; nothing created
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (busy) with correlation ID
      client --> page : Keep all input; failed state shows the reference ID;\nSave retries only when chosen, never automatically
    else Workspace not found
      db --> handler : No workspace
      handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing created
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (not found)
      client --> page : SprintForm emits notFound; the dialog closes with Outdated; the opening page\nincrements its counter and its reread shows Project not found with Back to projects
    else Workspace in Kanban mode (L2-027.3)
      db --> handler : Workspace and mode
      handler --> ctrl : 409 sprints paused; nothing created
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (sprints paused)
      client --> page : paused state: keep input; Save disabled; the alert explains that sprints are paused in Kanban mode\nand takes focus; no retry; SprintForm emits modeChanged; the dialog closes with ModeChanged and\nSprintsPage or SprintBoardPage calls ProjectLayoutPage.modeChanged()
    else Scrum mode
      db --> handler : Workspace and mode
      handler -> entity : L2-022 create Planned sprint with Toronto dates and version 1
      entity --> handler : New planned sprint
      handler -> db : L2-039 / L2-040 AddSprint; AddAuditEvent;\nSaveChangesAsync writes sprint and success audit in one transaction
      alt Commit fails
        db --> handler : Roll back sprint and success audit
        handler --> ctrl : Generic 500 with correlation ID
        ctrl --> client : Failure; no successful-save claim
        client --> page : Keep all input; failed state shows the reference ID;\nSave retries only when chosen
      else Commit succeeds
        db --> handler : New sprint ID and version
        handler --> ctrl : Created sprint
        ctrl --> client : 201 with sprint ID and version
        client --> page : SprintForm emits saved; the dialog closes with Saved(SprintSaveResult)
        page --> actor : The opening page opens the new sprint's planning page to choose stories;\nits heading takes focus and names the sprint
      end
    end
  end
end
note over ctrl, db
An unexpected 403 (access changed after sign-in) creates nothing; SprintForm keeps its input and emits
forbidden, which SprintFormDialog relays as its own forbidden while it stays open, and the opening
page shows the "Your access changed" toast through TOAST_SERVICE, without Retry.
A save that gets no response is uncertain: the form keeps its input, says "We couldn't confirm
whether Sprint 10 was saved." (no reference ID), and emits unconfirmed; SprintFormDialog relays it
and stays open, and the opening page increments its counter at once, so its sprints or board
reread and show the sprint if it was saved. Save stays unavailable; Cancel closes with no result.
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
